syncthing (2.1.6+keel1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * First Keel package (handbook decision 0050): the syncthing binary,
    built offline from the upstream release source with its vendor/
    tree, with the pinned Go 1.26.2 of the build host (docs/build.md).
    trixie's golang is 1.24 and go.mod needs go 1.26.2.
  * The package ships only /usr/bin/syncthing and the documentation:
    the systemd service, the system user and the configuration come
    from the keel-overlay-syncthing overlay.

